            {
                "entry_id": "2798ffb8-6bf3-3e38-9df8-da337204361f",
                "word": "весело",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                        "entry_id": "2798ffb8-6bf3-3e38-9df8-da337204361f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к весёлый; радостно, оживлённо, со смехом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2409e45d-5724-4dae-95cb-9a8178e258ba",
                                "sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                                "text": "Путешествие продолжалось и благополучно, и весело, а по приезде в Москву и суетно, и хлопотно."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d40d4df-9a31-4a5e-9d65-8e5ca89fda63",
                                "sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                                "text": "Глаза́ Степана Аркадьича весело заблестели, и он задумался, улыбаясь."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e15e4b3a-f6c2-4187-bf25-9fa8c19415e3",
                                "sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                                "text": "Народу набралось в зимовья порядком. Жили скученно, грязновато, но весело."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5526313f-8d6a-41fa-97c2-2e1903dc50cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "2798ffb8-6bf3-3e38-9df8-da337204361f",
                        "source_sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "merrily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "merrily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fdb002a-6d33-312d-a758-dce7c0bec2c5",
                                        "entry_id": "4320378a-29f8-361a-a4eb-326edb55c71e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a cheerful or merry way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ab30789-b84c-4a8f-a9a0-68943b899c72",
                                                "sense_id": "8fdb002a-6d33-312d-a758-dce7c0bec2c5",
                                                "text": "So quickly the poore mans ſubſtance is ſpent,\nBut merrily with the world it went,\nVVhen men eat berries of the hauthorne tree, […]\nAnd old men knew not vſurie:\nNow tis come to a wofull paſſe, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03ccccb1-b07b-47b7-82e1-83a44ca81c2c",
                                                "sense_id": "8fdb002a-6d33-312d-a758-dce7c0bec2c5",
                                                "text": "Ariell:\nWhere the Bee ſucks, there ſuck I,\nIn a Cowslips bell, I lie,\nThere I cowch when Owles doe crie,\nOn the Batts backe I doe flie\n  after Sommer merrily.\nMerrily, merrily, ſhall I liue now\nVnder the bloſſom that hangs on the Bow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63977960-5cfa-46e1-bfce-2792105a371d",
                                                "sense_id": "8fdb002a-6d33-312d-a758-dce7c0bec2c5",
                                                "text": "Then Heidi would sit down and chatter merrily away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1359738e-c845-47e5-8fbf-9b444b5fb57e",
                        "source_entry_id": "2798ffb8-6bf3-3e38-9df8-da337204361f",
                        "source_sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "cheerfully",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cheerfully",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c710f63-92b7-3f95-8bb8-97578e15f304",
                                        "entry_id": "51ad7a16-789d-37c1-9ad1-56da67663115",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a cheerful manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f61161b-ffb3-4299-b371-41e5a18570fc",
                                                "sense_id": "1c710f63-92b7-3f95-8bb8-97578e15f304",
                                                "text": "That principle carried out consistently and logically, makes the individual not a claimant upon society, but a benefiter of it. He contributes whatever talent, natural or acquired, he may have, cheerfully to the promotion of the common good, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0b4e27f-2e93-473e-87d4-0d64cd5a195c",
                                                "sense_id": "1c710f63-92b7-3f95-8bb8-97578e15f304",
                                                "text": "'Well, what have you done this time?' asked Sebastian cheerfully."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1694ba03-03f9-411d-bc8b-b05b0f9207bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "2798ffb8-6bf3-3e38-9df8-da337204361f",
                        "source_sense_id": "103ef43f-6947-30aa-aee5-43a4ba712ca5",
                        "target_lang_word": "spaßig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spaßig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0769c98-1ac1-3375-b588-4084e55357c9",
                                        "entry_id": "27811514-e8d8-328f-bc4b-b8c309ffb919",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mit Spaß, in der Art und Weise eines Spaßes, unterhaltsam, witzig, humorvoll"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eef6bcce-c19f-450b-a411-204de2df0441",
                                                "sense_id": "a0769c98-1ac1-3375-b588-4084e55357c9",
                                                "text": "Irgendwann geht auch der spaßigste Tag zu Ende."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6739def-3bfa-459a-bad8-3990a1525328",
                                                "sense_id": "a0769c98-1ac1-3375-b588-4084e55357c9",
                                                "text": "Das ist kein spaßiger Clown, nein, das ist ein Horrorclown."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b8f0b00-a35c-4e9d-9b89-ee4943b1221d",
                                                "sense_id": "a0769c98-1ac1-3375-b588-4084e55357c9",
                                                "text": "So, du meinst also, das sei spaßig?"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
